OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fwith clear spells at first, somewhat
OL,7,Fcloudier by the second half of the
OL,8,Fnight. The wind eases light, which may
OL,9,Fallow a few mist or fog patches to
OL,10,Fform in prone locations.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloudy periods to start, with
OL,13,Fpatchy rain gradually pushing
OL,14,Feastwards, possibly turning heavy
OL,15,Fovernight before clearing to give
OL,16,Fdrier and clear conditions.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
